For the error at line 43: At initial state: p = 2246, v.Length = 4684, v[1797] = 609, v[2247] = 6463. At a program state: i = 1. At a program state: max = 0.

Analyze the failure and respond with ONLY a valid JSON object — no explanation, no markdown, no code fences. Use exactly this structure:

